Modifications
-------------
The upstream web application has been modified and extended to run as an
Android application. Principal changes include:

  - Added a Capacitor 8 Android shell (poc/) with native plugins for secure
    API key storage (Android Keystore, AES-GCM), file saving to MediaStore,
    incoming share intents, media keep-alive, and window/splash theming.
  - Reworked the mobile UI (home, sidebar drawer, full-screen settings) to
    follow the layout of the official DeepSeek Android app.
  - Added history import/export compatible with DeepSeek's ZIP export format,
    including chunked native file writing for large archives.
  - Added API balance query (GET /user/balance) and an entry point to the
    DeepSeek platform usage page.
  - Added localization (Simplified Chinese / English), custom profile name and
    avatar, text-to-speech playback, and assorted accessibility fixes.

No upstream code has been removed except where replaced by the changes above.

